%N A398833 a(n) is the number of tilings of a 10 X n rectangle into L-pentominoes (no reflections, only rotations).
%H A398833 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A398833/b398833.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A398833 Nicolas Bělohoubek, Karol Gryszka and Antonín Slavík, <a href="https://www.karlin.mff.cuni.cz/~slavik/papers/pentominoes.pdf">A Guided Tour to Pentomino Tilings</a>
%H A398833 <a href="/index/Rec#order_10">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,1,0,0,1,0,0,0,0,1).
%F A398833 a(n) = a(n-2) + a(n-5) + a(n-10), for n > 9.
%F A398833 G.f: 1/(1-x^2-x^5-x^10).
%e A398833 a(10) = 3:
